'\">\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\">\n\t</div>\n\n\t<div class=\"text-center\" mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n\t  <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-12 content-text mb-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showText || showButtons\">\n\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>Most Customers Don't Forget Your Shop—They Forget Their Service</b></h5>\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">\n\t\t\t\t\tMost independent auto repair shops are focused on today's workload, leaving little time to contact customers when their next service is due. Without regular follow-ups, many customers simply forget or choose another repair shop. Our automated SMS and email reminder system keeps your business connected with every customer, encourages timely return visits, increases customer retention, and helps generate more repeat revenue with no extra effort from your staff.\n\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t<div id=\"video\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-4\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://workshop.eformics.com/signup.php\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\"><span class=\"mbrib-calendar mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\"></span>Start your 14-day free trial</a> \n                \t\t\t\t<a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\"><span class=\"mbrib-cash mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\"></span>No credit card required</a><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\"><span class=\"mbrib-close mbr-iconfont mbr