          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"list01 fantasym5\" group=\"List\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse\" name=\"reverseContent\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Label\" name=\"showLabel\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Container BG\" value=\"#ffd7ef\" name=\"containerBg\" selected>\n        <header>Cards</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Icon\" name=\"showIcon\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Icon BG\" value=\"#eb547a\" name=\"iconBg\" condition=\"showIcon\" selected>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showCardTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showCardText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showCardButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-11\">\n                <div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"row content-wrap justify-content-between\" mbr-class=\"{'flex-row-reverse' : reverseContent}\">\n                        <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-4\">\n                            <div class=\"title-wrapper\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-label mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showLabel\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-label\">ACCOUNT &amp; SUBSCRIPTION</p>\n                                <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title, .main-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>Managing Your Account</b></h2>\n                                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .text-wrap, .mbr-section-btn\">\n                                    Take full control of your Meccora account with flexible subscription management, billing options, and user settings. Find answers about upgrading, canceling, language preferences, data security, and everything you need to manage your workspace with confidence.\n                                </p>\n                                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn main-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://mobiri.se\" class=\"btn btn-black\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                                        GET STARTED\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-8\">\n                            <div class=\"item features-without-image\">\n                                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                                    <div class=\"iconfont-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showIcon\">\n                                        <span mbr-icon class=\"little-radius mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-success mbr-iconfont\" style=\"color: rgb(254, 239, 121);\"></span>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"card-box\">\n                                        <h4 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\" data-app-selector=\".item-title, .item-btn\"><b>Can I cancel my account?</b></h4>\n                                        <p class=\"item-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\" data-app-selector=\".item-text\">Yes — cancellation is built in and connected to billing: cancelling schedules your subscription to\n<br>end at period end and blocks login once it takes effect.</p>\n                                        <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-btn\" mbr-if=\"showCardButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                                            <a href=\"https://mobiri.se\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                                                LEARN MORE\n                                            </a>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"item features-without-image\">\n                                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                                    <div class=\"iconfont-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showIcon\">\n                                       <span mbr-icon class=\"little-radius mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-success mbr-iconfont\" style=\"color: rgb(254, 239, 121);\"></span>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"card-box\">\n                                        <h4 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\" data-app-selector=\".item-title, .item-btn\"><b>Can I upgrade my account?</b></h4>\n                                        <p class=\"item-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\" data-app-selector=\".item-text\">Yes, self-serve, through the billing portal — pick a new tier, and the price difference is charged\n<br>immediately.</p>\n                                        <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-btn\" mbr-if=\"showCardButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                                            <a href class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                                                LEARN MORE\n                                            </a>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"item features-without-image\">\n                                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                                    <div class=\"iconfont-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showIcon\">\n                                        <span mbr-icon class=\"little-radius mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-success mbr-iconfont\" style=\"color: rgb(254, 239, 121);\"></span>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"card-box\">\n                                        <h4 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\" data-app-selector=\".item-title, .item-btn\"><b>Can I pause my account?</b></h4>\n                                        <p class=\"item-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\" data-app-selector=\".item-text\">There's no owner-facing \"pause\" button today. Suspension (which pauses billing with no\n<br>charges while paused) is currently an admin-only action, not self-serve.</p>\n                                        <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-btn\" mbr-if=\"showCardButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                                            <a href class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                                                LEARN MORE\n                                            </a>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div><div class=\"item features-without-image\">\n                                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                                    <div class=\"iconfont-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showIcon\">\n                                        <span mbr-icon class=\"little-radius mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-success mbr-iconfont\" style=\"color: rgb(254, 239, 121);\"></span>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"card-box\">\n                                        <h4 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\" data-app-selector=\".item-title, .item-btn\"><b>Can I use multiple languages?</b></h4>\n                                        <p class=\"item-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\" data-app-selector=\".item-text\">Yes — English and French are supported per customer, controlling which language their\n<br>reminder emails/SMS go out in.</p>\n                                        <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-btn\" mbr-if=\"showCardButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                                            <a href class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                                                LEARN MORE\n                                            </a>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"item features-without-image\">\n                                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                                    <div class=\"iconfont-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showIcon\">\n                                        <span mbr-icon class=\"little-radius mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-success mbr-iconfont\" style=\"color: rgb(254, 239, 121);\"></span>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"card-box\">\n                                        <h4 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\" data-app-selector=\".item-title, .item-btn\"><b>Will my customers' data be safe if I ever stop using it?</b></h4>\n                                        <p class=\"item-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\" data-app-selector=\".item-text\">Yes. If you cancel, your data isn't deleted right away — it's kept for a grace period in case you\n<br>come back, then removed later. Nothing is wiped the moment you leave.</p>\n                                        <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-btn\" mbr-if=\"showCardButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                                            <a href class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                                                LEARN MORE\n                                            </a>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n\n                       \n                            \n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"container-fluid container-wrapper\">\n                        <div class=\"container-wrap card-wrap tl-large-radius tr-large-radius\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
