ry tool to turn browsers into buyers.</b></h2>\n                                <div class=\"text-wrapper\">\n                                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .text-wrapper\">\n                                        Build custom calculators, automate your pricing logic, and deliver instant quotes your customers can trust — all without writing a single line of code. See how each feature works together to save you time and win more business.\n                                    </p>\n                                </div>\n                                <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n                                    <a class=\"btn btn-black\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                                        Create video\n                                    </a>\n                                    <a class=\"btn btn-black-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                                        View more\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6 card\">\n                            <div class=\"image-wrapper card-wrap large-radius\">\n                                <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/image15.webp\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\">\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
